# lorekeeper scheduled tasks
# Paste into your crontab: crontab -e
# Requires: lore in PATH (cargo install --path crates/lk-cli)
# Working dir: <staged>
#
# On macOS prefer `lore schedule --format launchd`: cron SKIPS a job whose time
# passed while the machine was asleep, which silently drops a day's ingest.

0 7 * * * cd <staged> && lore --config <staged>/corpus/config.yaml ingest
